@startuml
title SYS01 - Failed validation, migration gate and deployment recovery

actor Operator
participant "Deployment workflow (deploy.yml)" as Workflow
participant "Backend validation job" as BackendTests
database "Runner PostgreSQL 18\n(ephemeral / isolated)" as RunnerDB
participant "SYS08 backup evidence" as Backup
participant "Previous known-good API image" as PreviousAPI
participant "DEI VM deploy agent" as Deploy
database "Shared DEI PostgreSQL 18" as DEIDB
participant "GitHub artifacts" as Artifacts

Operator -> Workflow: Start scheduled/manual deploy
Workflow -> Workflow: Wait for `dei-release` queue slot
Workflow -> Workflow: Acquire slot; resolve candidate SHA
Workflow -> BackendTests: Require RUN_DATABASE_TESTS=1

alt RUN_DATABASE_TESTS missing or not 1
  BackendTests --> Workflow: Explicit flag assertion fails
  Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive sanitized validation failure
  Workflow --> Operator: Failed before image packaging or SSH; VM unchanged
else Flag is 1; run PostgreSQL tests
  BackendTests -> RunnerDB: Apply migrations and execute DB suites
  alt PostgreSQL tests fail
    RunnerDB --> BackendTests: Test failure
    BackendTests --> Workflow: Backend validation fails
    Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive test output and diagnostics
    Workflow --> Operator: Failed before SSH; VM and DEI DB unchanged
  else Tests pass; candidate migration is pending
    RunnerDB --> BackendTests: Test suite passes
    BackendTests --> Workflow: Backend gate passes
    Workflow -> Backup: Require confirmed restorable SYS08 backup
    alt Backup confirmation absent
      Backup --> Workflow: Not confirmed
      Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive backup-gate failure
      Workflow --> Operator: Stop; do not skip migration or activate candidate
    else Backup confirmed; run compatibility gate
      Backup --> Workflow: Confirmation recorded
      Workflow -> RunnerDB: Create migrated scratch schema from synthetic baseline
      RunnerDB --> Workflow: Apply candidate migration to scratch DB
      Workflow -> PreviousAPI: Run prior-version compatibility suite against scratch DB
      alt Prior-version compatibility test fails
        PreviousAPI --> Workflow: Failure on migrated schema
        Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive compatibility test output
        Workflow --> Operator: Stop before migration to shared DEI database
      else Compatibility passes; production deploy begins
        PreviousAPI --> Workflow: Reads and writes pass
        Workflow -> Deploy: Apply migration to DEI database; activate candidate
        Deploy -> DEIDB: Apply versioned migration
        DEIDB --> Deploy: Migration succeeds
        Deploy --> Workflow: Candidate activated
        Workflow -> Deploy: Run deployed smoke checks
        Deploy --> Workflow: A required smoke check fails
        Workflow -> Deploy: Automatic recovery within same queue slot
        Deploy -> DEIDB: Start previous API; verify connectivity and read-only compatibility smoke
        DEIDB --> Deploy: Schema remains available to previous API
        Deploy --> Workflow: Report whether previous release is restored
        Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive failure, recovery and test evidence
        Workflow --> Operator: Run remains failed; queue slot released after archival
      end
    end
  end
end

note over Workflow,DEIDB
  CI database tests never connect to shared DEI PostgreSQL.
  Missing backup confirmation or failed old-version compatibility
  terminates the deploy path before shared migration and activation.
  Automatic recovery holds the same dei-release slot throughout.
end note
@enduml
